---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
  
  <!-- Section Title -->
  <div class="text-center mb-16 relative">
    <div class="inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 border border-violet-400/40 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(139,92,246,0.35)] mb-4 float-levitate">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-wider font-mono uppercase">
        ABOUT MYSELF
      </h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Story Card -->
  <div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/20 shadow-2xl relative mb-12">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-8 right-8 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-violet-400/80 to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-500/20 border border-violet-400/30 text-xs font-mono text-violet-300 mb-6 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(139,92,246,0.3)]">
      <span>⚡ MY STORY</span>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-white/80 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Hailing from the vibrant tech and cultural hub of <span class="text-white font-semibold">Kolkata, West Bengal, India 🇮🇳</span>, my journey began with a curiosity for how complex systems communicate beneath the surface. That drive led me to <span class="text-violet-300 font-semibold">Techno Main Salt Lake</span>, where I am currently pursuing my Bachelor of Computer Applications (<span class="text-violet-300 font-mono font-medium">BCA, Class of 2024–2028</span>). From the outset, I treated my academic curriculum not as a boundary, but as a launchpad.
      </p>
      <p>
        Early in my development path, I recognized that robust applications depend on thoughtful system architecture—low-latency database design, modular component structure, and streamlined deployment pipelines. Eager to build beyond classroom sandboxes, I immersed myself in the open-source ecosystem.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contributing to open-source projects fundamentally sharpened my engineering philosophy. It pushed me to navigate large, unfamiliar codebases, adhere to rigorous testing and documentation standards, and collaborate asynchronously with engineers worldwide. Every merged pull request and code review reinforced the importance of writing clean, maintainable, and high-performance code.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white font-medium">
        Today, my focus sits at the intersection of full-stack engineering, cloud deployments, and distributed systems. Whether architecting database schemas, optimizing web performance, or shipping meaningful contributions to community repositories, I approach engineering with a problem-solver’s mindset.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Highlights Grid (4 Glass Cards with Purple Vector Icons) -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">

    <!-- Card 1 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl hover:border-violet-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] group">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-violet-500/20 border border-violet-400/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(139,92,246,0.3)]">
        <svg class="purple-tech-logo w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-5 14H9v-2h6v2zm3-5H6V8h12v5z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors">Systems & Backend</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        Building high-performance distributed key-value stores, Raft consensus nodes, and asynchronous C++ engines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl hover:border-purple-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] group">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 border border-purple-400/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(168,85,247,0.3)]">
        <svg class="purple-tech-logo w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">Full Stack & AI</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        Creating AI analytics dashboards, responsive web interfaces, and modern full-stack web architectures.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl hover:border-fuchsia-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] group">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-fuchsia-500/20 border border-fuchsia-400/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(217,70,239,0.3)]">
        <svg class="purple-tech-logo w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM19 18H6c-2.21 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.05 1.53-3.76 3.56-3.97l1.07-.11.5-.95C8.08 7.14 9.94 6 12 6c2.62 0 4.88 1.86 5.39 4.43l.3 1.5 1.53.11c1.56.1 2.78 1.41 2.78 2.96 0 1.65-1.35 3-3 3z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-fuchsia-300 transition-colors">Cloud Native & MCP</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        Developing Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and contributing to open-source cloud native tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4 -->
    <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-400/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] group">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-400/40 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(129,140,248,0.3)]">
        <svg class="purple-tech-logo w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M17 1.01L7 1c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h10c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V3c0-1.1-.9-1.99-2-1.99zM17 19H7V5h10v14z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">Mobile & Cross-Platform</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        Designing microservice-backed crypto wallet applications using Flutter and Dart.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
